        NCC Leadership
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">
        Leadership & Guidance
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base leading-6 text-gray-600">
        The leadership and guidance supporting the NCC unit at Gautam Buddha
        University.
      </p>
    </div>

<!-- UNIVERSITY LEADERSHIP -->

    <div class="text-center mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-800">
        University Leadership
      </h3>

      <div class="mx-auto mt-2 w-10 h-1 bg-green-600 rounded-full"></div>
    </div>

<!-- CHANCELLOR + VICE CHANCELLOR -->

    <div
